@rsvp 1
@title The Art of Paying Attention
@source example.txt
@author RSVP Display
@language en
@chapter A quieter kind of reading
There is a particular pleasure in giving one thing your full attention. A sentence. A paragraph.
An idea you might otherwise have passed by.
@para
Reading can be a small pause in a busy day. You do not need to finish a chapter or reach a goal.
Sometimes it is enough to find a few words that stay with you.
@chapter One word at a time
Rapid Serial Visual Presentation shows a passage one word at a time, keeping your eyes in one
place while the text moves forward. Your pace sets the rhythm.
@para
This is a sample document for RSVP Display. Import your own .rsvp file to preview its chapters,
metadata, and text. Word-by-word playback will come in a future update.
